            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Yes. A treadmill can carry most of your mileage, including easy runs, tempo work and hill sessions. Use about 1% incline for steady and faster running, keep the room cool with a fan, and include some outdoor running — especially some long runs and downhills — because a belt cannot teach self-pacing, turns or descents.",
          },
        },
